      },
      "lineNbr": 324,
      "author": {
        "id": 1881060
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-12-05T03:35:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "At the end of the test, do you want to check that there has been some more intent sent that you did not handle ?\nCalling verifyNoMoreInteractions(mReceiver) will give you this guarantee.\n\nwithout that, you are not enforcing that the appropriate intent and only them are sent",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 324,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 324,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "6dd06554ecc90e093c2952477ec6a6537f9490b9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f5a88882_d2d9ae27",
        "filename": "framework/tests/bumble/src/android/bluetooth/PairingTest.java",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 324,
      "author": {
        "id": 1882530
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-12-11T16:17:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Any other intent is non-material to this test case. I don\u0027t think we need to make test cases brittle by preventing any future changes in the stack or the test cases.",
      "parentUuid": "6ad0526e_1f5e3595",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 324,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 324,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "6dd06554ecc90e093c2952477ec6a6537f9490b9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
