      "message": "If we received another BOND_STATE_CHANGE intent because or another ACL_CONNECTED, I would be happy to have the test fail as these are not expected in this scenario.\n\n\nSince the test is running in a controlled environment and since the intent filter are narrowed to the only scope of intent that are relevant to your scenario, I think this is very reasonable and future-proof to check that we are only receiving the expected intent.",
